  "source_review": [
    "Only SemanticFactBuilder._evaluate_const changes and one shared _admitted_numeric_result helper is added. Every other method AST remains identical.",
    "Both contextual UDF and ordinary expression paths consume the same existing model.node_types; only exact int values with admitted float result in v5/v6 widen. Boolean values are excluded.",
    "A receiving float variable does not reinterpret integer operands before their arithmetic; actual int expressions retain v5 truncation and v6 fractional division.",
    "The v1-v4 visitor, declaration/qualifier/type resolvers, catalog, call identity, default evidence, purity, cache, resource budget, compiler and runtime are unchanged.",
    "Overflow of integer-to-float conversion produces unknown. Existing contextual supported_scalar validation still rejects nonfinite results."
